that three quarters of their children no longer die before the age of 15?
Should we be hurt by the fact that the Roman Empire is gone? Should we,
prehaps, freeze the entire world into a sick kind of cultural zoo? Do
you believe that by, prehaps, forcing all people in the midwest to live
